UI.Notifications.AlienCrashdownDetail.First.2003=An alien vessel has crashed down in the {0} region in {1}. While the wreckage is unrecoverable, we suspect an alien life form escaped into the surrounding countryside.<br/><br/><h>The general public remains unaware of these events.</h>
